      "beats": [
        {
          "zone": "question",
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Mang Ernesto asks: Where can we confirm the health activity information? Vlanche has heard the same question from other residents. First, she listens.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 10360
        },
        {
          "zone": "roles",
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Provincial and City Health Boards oversee UHC integration. A BHW is not automatically a member. Vlanche asks the health team for the appropriate local contact.",
          "start_ms": 10660,
          "end_ms": 22340
        },
        {
          "zone": "observation",
          "index": 2,
          "text": "She summarises what she heard: a recurring question, conflicting information, and details still to confirm. The summary has no names or personal health details.",
          "start_ms": 22640,
          "end_ms": 35120
        },
        {
          "zone": "promotion",
          "index": 3,
          "text": "As a barangay HEPO, Vlanche checks the message with the team. She explains it simply, invites questions, and checks the resident’s understanding.",
          "start_ms": 35420,
          "end_ms": 46540
        },
        {
          "zone": "discussion",
          "index": 4,
          "text": "She practises with the midwife: Who can confirm and receive the suggestion? Who can decide? She does not promise that her idea is approved.",
          "start_ms": 46840,
          "end_ms": 58000
        },
        {
          "zone": "feedback",
          "index": 5,
          "text": "They agree when and how to follow up. She will share only confirmed feedback. The BHW contributes observation, accurate messaging, coordination and follow-up.",
          "start_ms": 58300,
          "end_ms": 70740
        }
      ],
